# Shipping surfaces

Do not land a user-facing Download, README release link, or `releases/latest` URL unless `.github/workflows/release.yml` publishes a `.dmg` on `v*` tags. A test that only checks the URL shape is unfinished work.

Do not merge to `main` without a pull request. `.github/workflows/ci.yml` must run `pnpm lint`, `pnpm typecheck`, and `pnpm test` on every PR.

`scripts/shipping-contract.test.mjs` must stay red if those workflows disappear or stop publishing the DMG.

Version increment is `pnpm bump <patch|minor|major|X.Y.Z>` only. Do not hand-edit one of package.json / tauri.conf.json / Cargo.toml / `APP_VERSION`.
